								<BinaryString name="SerializedOverrides"></BinaryString>
								<int64 name="SourceAssetId">-1</int64>
								<SharedString name="Tags">yuZpQdnvvUBOTYh1jqZ2cA==</SharedString>
								<UniqueId name="UniqueId">1f5f3983a820f33d0aedc38900000553</UniqueId>
							</Properties>
						</Item>
						<Item class="StringValue" referent="376">
							<Properties>
								<string name="Value"><![CDATA[# AsyncImage.card

Load an image with a placeholder.

Inside an app mount, set `local UI = app.UI`.

```luau
UI.AsyncImage "AsyncImage" { image = "rbxassetid://0" }
