UI.Grid "Grid" { columns = 2, UI.Text { text = "Item" } }
```

Key options: `columns`, `gap`.

Use VirtualGrid for an interactive collection.

Related controls: [Controls](Controls.md).

Open:

- [Grid.reference](Grid.reference.md)
]]></string>
