								<UniqueId name="HistoryId">00000000000000000000000000000000</UniqueId>
								<string name="Name">Screen.reference.md</string>
								<BinaryString name="SerializedOverrides"></BinaryString>
								<int64 name="SourceAssetId">-1</int64>
								<SharedString name="Tags">yuZpQdnvvUBOTYh1jqZ2cA==</SharedString>
								<UniqueId name="UniqueId">1f5f3983a820f33d0aedc38900000639</UniqueId>
							</Properties>
						</Item>
						<Item class="StringValue" referent="606">
							<Properties>
								<string name="Value"><![CDATA[# ScrollView.card

Scroll native content.

Inside an app mount, set `local UI = app.UI`.

```luau
UI.ScrollView "ScrollView" { UI.Text { text = "Ready" } }
```

Key options: `axis`, `scrollBar`.

Give the viewport a bounded parent.

Related controls: [Controls](Controls.md).

Open:

- [ScrollView.reference](ScrollView.reference.md)
]]></string>
