						<Item class="StringValue" referent="697">
							<Properties>
								<string name="Value"><![CDATA[# Classic Desktop

Dense tools.

Use the game-owned builder in [classic_desktop](../../../examples/themes/classic_desktop.luau). Check its return contract before use.

The source defines this theme's tokens and builder options. A theme changes paint, type, spacing and motion.
Use the same package for the controls and the native StyleSheet.

Open:

- [Themes](Themes.md)
- [Themes.classic_desktop.tokens](Themes.classic_desktop.tokens.md)
]]></string>
								<BinaryString name="AttributesSerialize"></BinaryString>
