						<Item class="StringValue" referent="712">
							<Properties>
								<string name="Value"><![CDATA[# Compact Pointer

Dense pointer tools.

Use the game-owned builder in [compact_pointer](../../../examples/themes/compact_pointer.luau). Check its return contract before use.

The source defines this theme's tokens and builder options. A theme changes paint, type, spacing and motion.
Use the same package for the controls and the native StyleSheet.

Open:

- [Themes](Themes.md)
- [Themes.compact_pointer.tokens](Themes.compact_pointer.tokens.md)
]]></string>
