						<Item class="StringValue" referent="723">
							<Properties>
								<string name="Value"><![CDATA[# Content alias

Asset alias tests.

Use the game-owned builder in [content_alias_test](../../../examples/themes/content_alias_test.luau). Check its return contract before use.

The source defines this theme's tokens and builder options. A theme changes paint, type, spacing and motion.
Use the same package for the controls and the native StyleSheet.

Open:

- [Themes](Themes.md)
- [Themes.content_alias_test.tokens](Themes.content_alias_test.tokens.md)
]]></string>
