								<string name="Value"><![CDATA[# Fantasy Parchment stub

Asset loading tests.

Use the game-owned builder in [fantasy_parchment_stub](../../../examples/themes/fantasy_parchment_stub.luau). Check its return contract before use.

The source defines this theme's tokens and builder options. A theme changes paint, type, spacing and motion.
Use the same package for the controls and the native StyleSheet.

