								<string name="Value"><![CDATA[# Glossy Mobile

Rounded mobile controls.

Use the game-owned builder in [glossy_mobile](../../../examples/themes/glossy_mobile.luau). Check its return contract before use.

The source defines this theme's tokens and builder options. A theme changes paint, type, spacing and motion.
Use the same package for the controls and the native StyleSheet.

Open:

- [Themes](Themes.md)
- [Themes.glossy_mobile.tokens](Themes.glossy_mobile.tokens.md)
]]></string>
