								<string name="Value"><![CDATA[# Theme index

Choose a look and a game task. Open one theme for tokens and options.

- [Themes](Themes.md) - Themes contract and options.
- [Themes.classic_desktop](Themes.classic_desktop.md) - Classic Desktop: Dense tools.
- [Themes.compact_pointer](Themes.compact_pointer.md) - Compact Pointer: Dense pointer tools.
- [Themes.content_alias_test](Themes.content_alias_test.md) - Content alias: Asset alias tests.
- [Themes.custom_control](Themes.custom_control.md) - Custom control: Control extension tests.
- [Themes.fantasy_ornate](Themes.fantasy_ornate.md) - Fantasy Ornate: Framed fantasy panels.
- [Themes.fantasy_parchment](Themes.fantasy_parchment.md) - Fantasy Parchment: Paper panels.
- [Themes.fantasy_parchment_stub](Themes.fantasy_parchment_stub.md) - Fantasy Parchment stub: Asset loading tests.
- [Themes.glossy_mobile](Themes.glossy_mobile.md) - Glossy Mobile: Rounded mobile controls.
- [Themes.glossy_touch](Themes.glossy_touch.md) - Glossy Touch: Prominent touch controls.
- [Themes.layered_test](Themes.layered_test.md) - Layered: Layered skin tests.
- [Themes.neutral](Themes.neutral.md) - Facet Neutral: Semantic colors for a game root.
- [Themes.ornate_gauge](Themes.ornate_gauge.md) - Ornate gauge: Gauge skin tests.
- [Themes.pixel_quest](Themes.pixel_quest.md) - Pixel Quest: Pixel art games.
- [Themes.scifi_hud](Themes.scifi_hud.md) - Sci-fi HUD: High contrast instruments.
]]></string>
