						<Item class="StringValue" referent="804">
							<Properties>
								<string name="Value"><![CDATA[# Layered

Layered skin tests.

Use the game-owned builder in [layered_test](../../../examples/themes/layered_test.luau). Check its return contract before use.

The source defines this theme's tokens and builder options. A theme changes paint, type, spacing and motion.
Use the same package for the controls and the native StyleSheet.

Open:

- [Themes](Themes.md)
- [Themes.layered_test.tokens](Themes.layered_test.tokens.md)
]]></string>
