						<Item class="StringValue" referent="814">
							<Properties>
								<string name="Value"><![CDATA[# Facet Neutral

Semantic colors for a game root.

Use `Facet.themes.neutralPackage()`. The palettes are Dark and Light.

The source defines this theme's tokens and builder options. A theme changes paint, type, spacing and motion.
Use the same package for the controls and the native StyleSheet.

Open:

- [Themes](Themes.md)
- [Themes.neutral.tokens](Themes.neutral.tokens.md)
]]></string>
