						<Item class="StringValue" referent="841">
							<Properties>
								<string name="Value"><![CDATA[# Sci-fi HUD

High contrast instruments.

Use the game-owned builder in [scifi_hud](../../../examples/themes/scifi_hud.luau). Check its return contract before use.

The source defines this theme's tokens and builder options. A theme changes paint, type, spacing and motion.
Use the same package for the controls and the native StyleSheet.

Open:

- [Themes](Themes.md)
- [Themes.scifi_hud.tokens](Themes.scifi_hud.tokens.md)
]]></string>
