								<string name="Value"><![CDATA[# Host and authoring guides

- [Roblox](https://github.com/voidmeld/compose/blob/c872f38ad12a73087175caccd3025d2fc9e18393/docs/roblox.md): the engine adapter and native verification.
- [Diagnostics](https://github.com/voidmeld/compose/blob/c872f38ad12a73087175caccd3025d2fc9e18393/docs/api.md#diagnostics): work counters, profiling and retention.
- [Authoring](https://github.com/voidmeld/compose/blob/c872f38ad12a73087175caccd3025d2fc9e18393/authoring/README.md): build-time content and project generation.

The consuming application manages its dependency pin and verifies the integration.
